@startuml F1.2-D01-primeiro-acesso-ok
title F1.2-D01 — Primeiro acesso (happy path)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "FirstAccessController" as Ctrl
participant "FirstAccessUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: senha + aceite LGPD / Continuar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /auth/first-access
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT usuario
Postgres --> UC: usuario

UC -> UC: Argon2id.verify\n(nova ≠ senha temporária)

UC -> Postgres: UPDATE senha\n(senha_alterada=true)\naceite_lgpd_em\nINSERT audit_log
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)

UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 OK

note right of WebApp
  Limpa mustChangePassword na store
  Sem novo JWT
end note

WebApp --> Aluno: redireciona /inicio

@enduml
